**What does this mean?**

This library is licensed so it can be used freely in commercial,
closed, and non-commercial projects without restriction. Using this
library's data in a board design does not require the design (or any
files generated from it) to be licensed under CC-BY-SA 4.0, and does
not require attribution within the design.

However, redistributing this library, or parts of it (including in
modified form) as a collection, must still be shared under the same
license, with attribution and this license document retained.

